### 1. 注册账号
POST http://localhost:8080/user/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "test",
    "password": "123456"
}

### 2. 登录（获取 token）
POST http://localhost:8080/user/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "test",
    "password": "123456"
}

### 3. 测试【不带 token】访问需要登录的接口 → 会被拦截
GET http://localhost:8080/user/info

### 4. 测试【带 token】访问 → 成功
GET http://localhost:8080/user/info
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJ1c2VybmFtZSI6InRlc3QiLCJleHAiOjE3NzYzNTkwNzZ9.L1u2E4tVcs29-atJiqmJ-TWAdyCl0Xv3Xsy10KwLPyM